# What every image build leaves out of its context, the repository root. Each Dockerfile copies
# what it needs from the rest by path. Build output, installed dependencies and local settings
# would make a build depend on the machine it ran on, and .env files hold secrets. See
# infra/hosted/README.md.
.git
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
e2e/screenshots/

# Caches the tools write beside the code, never read by a build.
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.DS_Store
